    "canonical_filename_pattern": "<ElementSymbol>.upf",
    "hf_dual_version": "Hf has two versions in GBRV. Default symlink Hf.upf points to hf_pbe_v1.uspp.F.UPF (standard). The plus4 variant is exposed as Hf_plus4.upf -> hf_pbe_plus4_v1.uspp.F.UPF, for +4 oxidation states where the semi-core state treatment differs.",
